<title>UK: Swedish Export Credit sets $70 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Swedish Export Credit sets $70 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Nikko Europe and Tokyo Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    $70 MLN	 COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    27.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE  L-24.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA+   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES    L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
